Up to 128 different fruits can coexist in a given game, to allow for
successive bones file loading. (New fruits discovered beyond that
point will get named after a random existing fruit.) Wishing for
"fruit" will get you whatever your current fruit setting is. Wishing
for "slime mold" will only get you one if that's been a fruitname used
in your game at some point.

